Enable the repository hooks (no extra packages):

    git config core.hooksPath .githooks

Git then runs .githooks/pre-commit and .githooks/pre-push. Hooks are
bypassable with --no-verify; CI re-runs the same checks on the head SHA.

N2 (accepted): local hooks skip the label guard and approver when there
is no pull request yet, or when gh is missing. CI always fail-closes.
